###############################################################################

Welcome to hybrid-d77 (built on Chimera Linux). To log in, use either of:

	- root:@PASSWORD@
	- @USER@:@PASSWORD@

The `@USER@` user is in the group `wheel`, which has `doas(1)` permissions.

To install the system to disk, run: doas h77-installer

Thank you for trying hybrid-d77!

    https://github.com/dani-77/hybrid-d77
    https://chimera-linux.org

###############################################################################
